THIRD-PARTY MODEL PORTS

src/models/index.ts contains re-implementations, in TypeScript, of three
MIT-licensed human-typing projects. Their authors are credited in that file
and in README.md; the ports are original code written against the published
behaviour and constants of those projects, and are covered by the MIT licence
above. The upstream projects are:

  - Lax3n/HumanTyping          https://github.com/Lax3n/HumanTyping          (MIT)
  - Shawn-Falconbury/human-typer  https://github.com/Shawn-Falconbury/human-typer  (MIT)
  - djeada/Type-Simulator      https://github.com/djeada/Type-Simulator      (MIT)
